{"id":"c43e6e534a61346e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-high-random-separation.md","title":"高程度的随机性分离刻画","display":"thm-high-random-separation — 高程度的随机性分离刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-high-random-separation","aliases":["43-thm-high-random-separation"],"display":"thm-high-random-separation — 高程度的随机性分离刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-comprandom]]","[[43-df-schnorrrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.8，印刷222，PDF242","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-high-random-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-high-random-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-high-random-separation — 高程度的随机性分离刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.8，印刷222，PDF242"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；跳跃、归约及随机性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c8d43a74ea8721f3\" href=\"?note=c8d43a74ea8721f3\" title=\"43-df-schnorrrandom\">43-df-schnorrrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\le_TA\\prime\\iff\\exists B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(B)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\le_TA\\prime\\iff\\exists B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(B)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{MLRandom}(B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\le_TA\\prime\\iff\\exists C\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(C\\equiv_TA\\land\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(C)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\prime\\prime\\le_TA\\prime\\iff\\exists C\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(C\\equiv_TA\\land\\mathrm{SchnorrRandom}(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(C)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个存在量词独立，B和C不必同一个点；高性是A′计算0″。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.2 Theorem 10.4.8，印刷222，PDF242。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","